title: 'Q20, placement: I time how long the first diff-view request takes right after a teammate saves (when Git HEADs are re-read). Where do I record the measurement?'
pid: 3b41d02a-2a1c-43bc-86d2-dd35aaad1ccd
body: |2-
  Key: Acceptable: 'the diff view, as built' > 'The straddle is rebuilt more often than it looks.' (which says 'Not measured'), or the design's 'Speed is not in the way, except where foreign files reload.' Wrong: the plan, or 'A mark rides on a save'.
  Where, as left: drawn: "The straddle is rebuilt more often than it looks."; design > "Speed is not in the way, except where foreign files reload."
  Why asked: Jeff's 'intolerably slow'; any speed work
  Scores, Haiku 1-3 then Sonnet 1-3 (R right, W wrong, - not said): as left --RRRR, tended R--RRR.
